<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the right equipment, you'll be able to launch enemies away the moment they get close!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having the appropriate weapons makes infiltrating enemy bases much easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/b012fd3f95b487942d925985d7c9cff4.poster.avif?t=1768899349\" width=612 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/b012fd3f95b487942d925985d7c9cff4.webm?t=1768899349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/b012fd3f95b487942d925985d7c9cff4.mp4?t=1768899349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the other hand, entering without the correct weapons means you'll have to avoid all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hit too many times, and it's an instant GAME OVER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/d64ec37a5d3b19fd61b55c37268f57eb.poster.avif?t=1768899349\" width=612 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/d64ec37a5d3b19fd61b55c37268f57eb.webm?t=1768899349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/extras/d64ec37a5d3b19fd61b55c37268f57eb.mp4?t=1768899349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["\u30aa\u30cb\u30c1\u30af\u5c4b\uff01"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689830/f926d52d0cb1719baf97978e2a8094698